    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D beat 'em up, become a maverick in the absurd corporate world! Grab your weapon, smash through chaos, and unleash destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689920/extras/3d4adfbcafcfeeee0e57732ca9ac9cd0.poster.avif?t=1752474264\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689920/extras/3d4adfbcafcfeeee0e57732ca9ac9cd0.webm?t=1752474264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689920/extras/3d4adfbcafcfeeee0e57732ca9ac9cd0.mp4?t=1752474264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Pick up different weapons to fight and unlock different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Use the objects in the environment to hurl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Defeat different workplace enemies and bosses.</p>",
